# Judging

- Never average raw scores and call it done.
- Weighted organizer rubric; weights sum to 1.
- Robust z-score (median/MAD). Constant raters (MAD=0) must not divide-by-zero.
- Incomplete batches: document shrink/exclude; persist `normalization_runs`.
- Pairwise is an alternative mode, original MIT code, cite Gavel/Thurstone — do not fork Gavel.
- Load `.skills/judging-maths/SKILL.md`.
- Update `JUDGING.md` in the same change.
